      <definition>v.t. To hide, conceal, keep secret</definition>
      <page>579</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠢᠭᠣᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n</transcript>
          <definition> Secretly, surreptitiously.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠢᠭᠣᠨ ᠨᠡᠪᠲᠡᠭᠡᠷᠡᠭᠦᠯᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n nebteregylky</transcript>
          <definition> To smuggle, import secretly.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠢᠭᠣᠨ ᠨᠡᠪᠲᠡᠷᠡᠭᠦᠯᠦᠭᠰᠡᠨ ᠡᠳ ᠪᠠᠷᠠᠭ᠎ᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n nebteregylygsen [ed] baraγ-a</transcript>
          <definition> Contraband, smuggled goods.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠢᠭᠣᠬᠤ ᠭᠠᠵᠠᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>--xu γazar </transcript>
