          <definition> To hide oneself; to live incognito, in hiding.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠦᠭᠡ ᠨᠢᠭᠣᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>yge –xu </transcript>
          <definition>To keep a secret</definition>
